rnaseq/CITATIONS.md
rnaseq/CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md
rnaseq/LICENSE
rnaseq/README.md
rnaseq/main.nf
rnaseq/modules.json
rnaseq/nextflow.config
rnaseq/nextflow_schema.json
rnaseq/nf-test.config
rnaseq/ro-crate-metadata.json
rnaseq/run_nextflow.sh
rnaseq/tower.yml

